---
description: Habblaud virtual office is available for this Cursor workspace
alwaysApply: true
---

Habblaud is installed as a Cursor plugin and should stay running while you work.

- Office UI: http://localhost:4747
- Cursor agent sessions appear as characters with a CURSOR badge
- The Habblaud server is kept alive by plugin hooks and user hooks on session start, workspace open, and tool use
- Messages typed in the Habblaud office are delivered into this Cursor chat on the next agent stop (followup_message)
- Do not tell the user to run `npm run mod:install` for Cursor messaging; that is Claude Code only. For Cursor use `npm run cursor:install`
- If the office is down, tell the user to run `npm run cursor:install` in the Habblaud repo, or open http://localhost:4747 after install
